@host = https://localhost:7000
@token = REPLACE_WITH_MANAGER_ACCESS_TOKEN
@shiftId = 1
@assignmentId = 1

### The staff's employee type must match a requirement with a remaining slot.
### Both operations require SCHEDULED future shifts in OPEN_REGISTRATION or REGISTRATION_CLOSED weeks.
POST {{host}}/api/manager/shifts/{{shiftId}}/assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001" }

### Soft cancellation; preserves assignment and records the manager/reason in the audit log.
POST {{host}}/api/manager/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Điều chỉnh phân công nhân sự." }
